meta {
  name: Search-Users
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: http://localhost:5000/profile/search?q={{searchQuery}}&role={{globalRole}}&limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  x-user-id: {{requesterId}}
}

vars:pre-request {
  requesterId: 1
  searchQuery: "John"
  globalRole: "user"
  limit: 20
  offset: 0
}

docs {
  # User Search API
  
  This endpoint searches for users based on various criteria including name, email, and role.
  
  ## Authentication
  - Requires a valid user ID in the x-user-id header
  - Regular users can only search with limited functionality
  - Advanced search options available to admins and supervisors
  
  ## Query Parameters
  - `q`: Search query - matches against displayName, firstName, lastName, or email (required)
  - `role`: Filter by global role (optional)
    - Available roles: user, supervisor, uniAdmin, inmaAdmin
  - `limit`: Maximum number of results to return (optional, default: 20)
  - `offset`: Number of results to skip for pagination (optional, default: 0)
  
  ## Admin-Only Parameters
  - `uniId`: Search by university ID (exact match)
  - `nationalId`: Search by national ID (exact match)
  
  ## Example
  ```
  GET /profile/search?q=John&role=user&limit=20&offset=0
  x-user-id: 1
  ```
  
  ## Response
  - `200 OK` on success with array of matching users and pagination metadata:
    ```json
    {
      "data": [
        {
          "uuid": "user-uuid-1",
          "displayName": "John Smith",
          "firstName": "John",
          "lastName": "Smith",
          "email": "john.smith@university.edu.sa",
          "profileImage": "https://example.com/avatar1.jpg",
          "globalRole": "user"
        },
        {
          "uuid": "user-uuid-2",
          "displayName": "Johnny Doe",
          "firstName": "Johnny",
          "lastName": "Doe",
          "email": "johnny.doe@university.edu.sa",
          "profileImage": "https://example.com/avatar2.jpg",
          "globalRole": "user"
        }
      ],
      "pagination": {
        "total": 42,
        "limit": 20,
        "offset": 0,
        "hasMore": true
      }
    }
    ```
  - `400 Bad Request` if required parameters are missing or invalid
  - `401 Unauthorized` if the requester is not authenticated
  - `403 Forbidden` if using admin-only parameters without admin privileges
  - `500 Internal Server Error` for server issues
}
